Version 0.2-1
        - Added optional argument S to high-level functions to allow for supplying a structure vector matrix directly. Finished seprows, linearities and reccone high-level functions. Added generics and methods for pre- and post-fit functionality.  

Version 0.2-0
	- Renamed all $offobs and sepobs to $offrows and $seprows. Changed the summary and print to also reflect that. Add a b_Xstar.

